Practical 1
Create a simple HTML page displaying personal details using text formatting tags.
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Personal Details</title>
</head>
<body>

    <h1><u>My Personal Details</u></h1>

    <p><b>Name:</b> John Doe</p>
    <p><strong>Age:</strong> 21</p>
    <p><i>Course:</i> Computer Science</p>
    <p><em>University:</em> ABC University</p>
    <p><u>Email:</u> johndoe@example.com</p>

    <p><b>Address:</b> <i>123 Main Street, City, Country</i></p>

    <p><strong>Hobbies:</strong> 
        <u>Reading</u>, 
        <i>Traveling</i>, 
        <b>Gaming</b>
    </p>

</body>
</html>
